  "application_type_full": "Prior Approval: Larger Home Extension",
  "description": "The proposal is for the demolition of the  existing single storey rear conservatory and the introduction of a ‘larger home’ single storey rear extension’ totalling 4.1m deep x 3m high, with associated internal alterations and a flat roof skylight. \n\nThe proposed single storey element will not exceed 3m in height above the existing external level and has been set away by 150mm and 950mm (approx.) from the side boundaries. Further works associated in the application include minor internal layout alterations.\n\nAs demonstrated in the supporting drawings, the proposed rear extension has been designed to match the depth of the adjacent existing single storey rear extension at no. 109 Ferney Road\n\nThe proposed design has been carefully developed to respect the original property, incorporating elements that complement rather than disrupt the architectural diversity of the surrounding area. The selected material palette includes brickwork, double-glazed windows, and linear/detailed fascia, all chosen to match the existing dwelling.\n",
